<LanguageData>

  <DS_PlasmaCutter.label>211-V等离子切割机</DS_PlasmaCutter.label>
  <DS_PlasmaCutter.description>211-V等离子切割机是一种高能矿物切割机，当发射时会产生紧密的等离子流。\n事实证明这种切割机用来切割怪物的肢体也很有效</DS_PlasmaCutter.description>
  <DS_PlasmaCutter.tools.0.label>枪管</DS_PlasmaCutter.tools.0.label>

  <DS_PulseRifle.label>SWS脉冲步枪</DS_PulseRifle.label>
  <DS_PulseRifle.description>一种军用级别的步枪可以以超音速射出超低口径子弹，每一发子弹拥有巨大的动能</DS_PulseRifle.description>
  <DS_PulseRifle.tools.0.label>枪管</DS_PulseRifle.tools.0.label>

  <DS_SeekerRifle.label>探索者步枪</DS_SeekerRifle.label>
  <DS_SeekerRifle.description>高精度的射手步枪，有着不俗的伤害和搞穿透力</DS_SeekerRifle.description>
  <DS_SeekerRifle.tools.0.label>枪管</DS_SeekerRifle.tools.0.label>

  <DS_ContactBeam.label>C-99接触光束</DS_ContactBeam.label>shu
  <DS_ContactBeam.description>C-99接触光束是一种小型粒子加速器。\n粒子会被完全充能并发射，粒子束接触到物体会产生爆炸。</DS_ContactBeam.description>
  <DS_ContactBeam.tools.0.label>枪管</DS_ContactBeam.tools.0.label>

  <DS_FlameThrower.label>PFM-100火焰喷射器</DS_FlameThrower.label>shu
  <DS_FlameThrower.description>PFM-100氢肼火焰喷射器是设计用来将500至4000摄氏度的液体氢肼火焰射向冰层、从而发现埋藏在底下的矿石</DS_FlameThrower.description>
  <DS_FlameThrower.tools.0.label>枪管</DS_FlameThrower.tools.0.label>

  <DS_ForceGun.label>动能枪</DS_ForceGun.label>shu
  <DS_ForceGun.description>又称为手持式重力加速器，能在前方产生爆炸冲击波，可以击碎矿石等坚硬物体。</DS_ForceGun.description>
  <DS_ForceGun.tools.0.label>枪管</DS_ForceGun.tools.0.label>

